# BIT-1's secret, BIT BEAT: SEL + REC on track 1 (the kit). Left alone, the notes go by: misses, the heat stays
# low; playing itself (autoplay), every note hits, the combo climbs, the other tracks mutate; HOME leaves and
# every value is back (the song as saved never changed)
wait 500
expect par26 1
press SEL
tap REC
release SEL
expect game 1
expect gstate 0
shot game_count.png
wait 2600
expect gstate 1
expect playing 1
wait 4000
expect gmiss >5
expect gscore 0
shot game_miss.png
autoplay 1
wait 9000
expect ghits >30
expect gcombo >20
expect glevel >1
shot game_play.png
tap HOME
expect game 0
expect par26 1
expect dirty 0
